  femalePlayerTalkingPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f4ffd3f5ee3068b4d9fc4a49eb3eb079, type: 3}
  femalePlayerThinkingPortrait: {fileID: 0}
  femalePlayerSmilingPortrait: {fileID: 0}
  npc2Name: 
  npcPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 594109a26197a644e88c1a8d9d9fe860, type: 3}
  npcTalkingPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 594109a26197a644e88c1a8d9d9fe860, type: 3}
  npcThinkingPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 594109a26197a644e88c1a8d9d9fe860, type: 3}
  npcSmilingPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 594109a26197a644e88c1a8d9d9fe860, type: 3}
  npc2Portrait: {fileID: 0}
  npc2TalkingPortrait: {fileID: 0}
  npc2ThinkingPortrait: {fileID: 0}
  npc2SmilingPortrait: {fileID: 0}
  background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a47d1b04251684747935c3c903086ed3, type: 3}
  lines:
  - speaker: 1
    mood: 0
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    text: Oh, tamu? Ada yang bisa dibantu?
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 26b05b91cb776e5449766989e9a628a3, type: 3}
    femalePlayerVoiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: 0
    mood: 0
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    text: Pak, saya mau tanya. Wi-Fi kafe ini namanya CafeBean_Free kan? Tapi ada
      juga FREE_CAFE_WIFI dan CafeBean_Free_5G. Itu punya kafe juga?
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3f4e1144693dd684db2c7c1960bdca51, type: 3}
    femalePlayerVoiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 15834b70388d86d46b061e7f0308eb96, type: 3}
  - speaker: 1
    mood: 2
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    text: Bukan. Kami hanya punya satu jaringan, CafeBean_Free. Yang lain bukan milik
      kami.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f04412e15c22ee44cb1fa2206d85bf20, type: 3}
    femalePlayerVoiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: 0
    mood: 0
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    text: Jadi ada yang sengaja bikin jaringan palsu?
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b07d24c889eb9a747a14fc5f4f50ea64, type: 3}
    femalePlayerVoiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: bc8e112d91b37e64e86382647636e002, type: 3}
  - speaker: 1
    mood: 0
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    text: Ini disebut Evil Twin Attack. Seseorang membuat hotspot dengan nama yang
      mirip Wi-Fi asli.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ac7ec2e8ac97eb543a95f6888021ac94, type: 3}
    femalePlayerVoiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: 1
    mood: 0
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    text: 'Kalau orang connect ke sana, data yang dikirim bisa disadap: password,
      email, bahkan data kartu kredit.'
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 37502e0c7defd5a48b15e1132b7a265a, type: 3}
    femalePlayerVoiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: 0
    mood: 0
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    text: Orangnya masih di sini?
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: cd1039b939471de41b14a1e2a01660aa, type: 3}
    femalePlayerVoiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fcd8e6cce4376dc41bb7f4714b276e32, type: 3}
  - speaker: 1
    mood: 0
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    text: Kemungkinan besar iya. Pelakunya harus berada dalam jangkauan fisik. Perhatikan
      orang yang membawa router portable atau laptop dengan antena tambahan.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ff9a137b4655b0145ac6afea722131d9, type: 3}
    femalePlayerVoiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: 0
    mood: 0
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    text: Saya coba cari.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fe2f82d3c6c51e540833af93b1b5220a, type: 3}
    femalePlayerVoiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d27bb6e545438eb4bb73c63cc67877ae, type: 3}
  - speaker: 1
    mood: 0
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    text: Hati-hati. Kalau sudah ketemu, jangan konfrontasi sendiri. Langsung kabari
      saya.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1f495a587319b6d449d38d4aaccfd410, type: 3}
    femalePlayerVoiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  hasChoice: 0
  acceptText: Ya
  rejectText: Tidak
  dialogueIfAccepted: {fileID: 0}
  dialogueIfRejected: {fileID: 0}
  actionID: VN_Topic5_PakHendra
